  "prefLabel": "Res 2704.07 Grant Review Committee Meetings",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 2704.07 Grant Review Committee Meetings. A grant review committee established in accordance to RSA 12-A:54, II(b) shall hold bi-monthly meetings for the purpose of reviewing applications. Notification of meeting dates shall be posted on the DED website at least 15 business days in advance of a scheduled meeting.\n\nSource. #8975, INTERIM, eff 9-14-07, EXPIRED: 3-12-08\n\nNew. #9498, eff 7-1-09 (from Res 2704.06), EXPIRED: 7-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res2700.html"
